'''The March of Flames''' (烈火の乱, ''Rekka no Ran'', '''Raging Fire''') is a group of special stages appearing during special occasions. It was added in [[Version 11.2 Update|Version 11.2]].

==Event Information==
*{{Color|#FF6D01|'''A relentless attack by Red enemies in the "March of Flames" map! Fight off a full-on assault by Red enemies in this limited map!'''}}<br>
Fight off a full-on assault by Red enemies in this limited map! Hold back the crimson invaders threatening the Cat Empire!<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''On between December 11th (11:00am) and finishes on December 18th (10:59am)!'''}}

※ After clearing a stage, the next stage can be attempted after some time has passed.<br>
※ Spend a Catamin A during the cooldown period to skip the waiting time and challenge the stage immediately.

